e is inked black  The overlying skin ellipse contains nipple areolar complex and measures REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm  The nipple is mobile and measures 1 4cm in greatest dimension  On sectioning  the breast parenchyma of the upper quadrants show an irregularly outlined gray white to tan pink  firm to hard mass measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm  The mass is located approximately between 11 and 1 o clock positions and is 0 8cm from the anterior surface and 7 0cm from the nearest posterior surface  Approximately 1 5cm posterior and lateral to this tumor  the breast parenchyma of the upper outer quadrant shows another irregularly outlined  tan pink to gray white  firm to hard possible tumor  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm  This mass is located 1 8cm from the anterior surface and 6 0cm from the nearest posterior surface  The breast parenchyma surrounding both the tumors shows diffuse and dense fibrosis  In the remaining area  the breast parenchyma consists of admixed fatty tissue and dense pink white fibrous stroma which is nodular focally and contains a few blue domed cysts measuring from 0 3cm up to 0 7cm in greatest dimension  Obvious lymph nodes are not identified in the lateral portion of the breast tissue  Sections are submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Larger tumor  upper quadrants   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Smaller possible tumor  upper outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Breast parenchyma between the 2 tumors   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Breast parenchyma away from the tumor   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lateral portion of the breast without lymph nodes  Received fresh  labeled  right breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 10 0cm right simple mastectomy with a short stitch marking superior margin and a long stitch marking the lateral end  The anterior surface is inked blue and the posterior surface is inked black  The overlying tan pink skin contains nipple areola complex and measures REMOVED_DATE