eived fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast   is a 390 grams  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm product of a right simple mastectomy  with a REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm tan pink skin ellipse displaying a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm centrally nipple  The anterior surface of the specimen is inked blue  and the posterior surface is inked black  There is a short stitch denoting the superior aspect  and a long stitch denoting the lateral aspect  The specimen is serially sectioned to show a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm ill defined  tan pink  granular mass located in the lower outer quadrant  1 0cm from the anterior margin  0 5cm from the posterior margin  1 0cm from the interior margin  8 0cm from the superior margin  9 0cm from the medial margin  and 3 0cm from the lateral margin  The remaining uninvolved breast parenchyma consists of tan yellow  fibrofatty tissue  with no other discrete masses identified  No lymph nodes are grossly identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows  L S  Representative sections of the aforementioned mass  T U  Additional representative sections of breast parenchyma away from mass  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm  420 grams  product of a left simple mastectomy  consisting of a REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm tan pink skin ellipse with a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm centrally located nipple  There is a short suture designating the superior aspect of the specimen  and a long stitch designating the lateral portion of the specimen  The anterior portion is inked blue  and the posterior is inked black  Centrally located  subjacent to the nipple there is an ill defined  tan yellow  granular lesion  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm  located 1 0cm from the posterior margin  0 5cm from the anterior margin  7 5cm from the lateral margin  and 7 0cm from the medial margin  6 5cm from t