s that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  12 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 06 48 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm piece of fibroadipose tissue  which is inked and sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm pink gray  granular  firm nodule  abutting the inked margins  A representative section of the nodule is frozen as FX 1  now submitted in A  Representative sections of tumor are submitted in A G  and normal breast is submitted in H  Resident  JAMES J  TIESINGA  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST NODULE  RIGHT   INVASIVE DUCTAL CARCINOMA  EXTENDING TO THE INKED MARGIN OF RESECTION  O R  Resident  EDI BROGI  MD  PhD O R  Diagnosis by  Robin E  Kirby  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , Unchecked.
