n with focal areas of bright yellow fat necrosis  Final Diagnosis by David C Wilbur M D   Electronically signed on Tuesday February 17   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 04 26 38PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  PART A  Breast  Left  Medial Margin   Excision PART B  Breast  Left  Inferior Margin   Excision  report_end  , Unchecked.
